        "solution": "[1÷(x\u003Csup\u003E2\u003C/sup\u003E + 3x +2)] + [1 ÷ (x\u003Csup\u003E2\u003C/sup\u003E + 5x + 6)]\n \n\n= 1 ÷ (x\u003Csup\u003E2\u003C/sup\u003E + 3x + 2) + [1 ÷ (x\u003Csup\u003E2\u003C/sup\u003E + 5x + 6)]\n\n\n= [1 ÷ ((x\u003Csup\u003E2\u003C/sup\u003E + x) + (2x + 2))] + [1 ÷ ((x\u003Csup\u003E2\u003C/sup\u003E + 3x) + (2x + 6))]\n\n\n= [1 ÷ (x(x + 2) + 2(x +1))] + [1 ÷ (x(x + 3) +2(x + 3) )]\n\n= [1 ÷ (x + 1)(x + 2)] + [1 ÷ ((x + 3) + (x + 2))]\n\n=((x + 3) + (x + 1)) ÷ (x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3)\n\nUsing the L.C.M\n\n=((x + x + 3 + 1)) ÷ (x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3)\n\n=(2x+4)/(x+1)(x+2)(x+3) =2(x+2)/(x+1)(x+2)(x+3)\n\n= 2/(x+1)(x+3)",
