        "question": "Find the principal which amounts to ₦ 5,500 at a simple interest in 5 years at 2% per annum",
        "option": {
          "a": " ₦ 4,900",
          "b": "₦ 5,000",
          "c": "₦ 4,700",
          "d": "₦ 4,000"
        },
        "section": "",
        "image": "",
        "answer": "b",
        "solution": "Principal = P, Simple Interest = I, Amount = A\n\nAmount = Principal + Simple Interest\n\nI = PRT/100\n\n\nR = rate, T = time\n\nI = (P×5×2)/100\n\n\nI = 10P/100\n\n\nI = P/10\n\n\nAmount A = P + I\n\n5500 = P + P/10\n\n\nMultiply through by 100\n\n5500 = 10P + P\n\n5500 = 11P\n\np = 5500/11\n\n\np = ₦5000",
        "examtype": "utme",
        "examyear": "2017"
      },
