        "question": "If w varies inversely as (uv)/(u + v) and w = 8 when\n\nu = 2 and v = 6, find a relationship between u, v, w.",
        "option": {
          "a": "uvw = 16(u + v)",
          "b": "16uv = 3w(u + v)",
          "c": "uvw = 12(u + v)",
          "d": "12uvw = u + v"
        },
        "section": "",
        "image": "",
        "answer": "c",
        "solution": "W α (1/uv)/(u + v)\n\n\n∴ w = (k/uv)/(u + v)\n\n\n= k(u+v)/(uv)\n\n\nw = k(u+v)/uv\n\n\nw = 8, u = 2 and v = 6\n\n8 = k(2+6)/2(6)\n\n\n= k(8)/12\n\n\nk = 12\n\ni.e 12 ( u + v) = uwv",
        "examtype": "utme",
        "examyear": "2021"
      },
